# The repo is LF-only: .editorconfig sets end_of_line = lf and .prettierrc sets
# endOfLine: "lf", so the eslint-plugin-prettier rule flags every line of a CRLF
# file ("Delete `␍`"). Without this file, a Windows checkout with
# core.autocrlf=true rewrites the working tree to CRLF and the whole repo lights
# up red in the editor. `eol=lf` pins the working tree to LF regardless of each
# developer's core.autocrlf setting.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Playwright screenshot baselines and any other binaries: never touch the bytes.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.zip binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
